    "status": "draft"
  },
  "data": {
    "acts": [
      {
        "id": "act-01",
        "title": "九坛·春社",
        "backgroundAssetId": "background.nine-altars-day",
        "characters": [
          {"instanceId": "shisheng", "assetId": "character.shi-sheng", "position": "left"},
          {"instanceId": "wensheng", "assetId": "character.wen-sheng", "position": "center"},
          {"instanceId": "fuqin", "assetId": "character.fuqin", "position": "right"}
        ],
        "texts": [
          {"id": "act-01-text-01", "content": "我们村叫九坛村，村外九座社坛一字排开，一位土地爷守一座坛。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-01-text-02", "content": "头一坛管着全村最好的坝子田，香火最旺。往后一座薄过一座，到第九坛，只管着村尾一片乱石坡。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-01-text-03", "content": "我家祖上传下来的差事，就是守第九坛。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-01-text-04", "content": "今年春社，头坛前围满了人。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-01-text-05", "content": "（把新香炉摆上头坛正位）各位叔伯，文生托县衙的福，补了廪，往后就在衙门当差！添个香炉，谢土地爷！", "speakerId": "wensheng", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "文生"}},
          {"id": "act-01-text-06", "content": "好！咱族里就数文生出息！读书做官，这才叫正经营生！", "speakerId": "sanshugong", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "三叔公"}},
          {"id": "act-01-text-07", "content": "人群让开一条道，人人都要跟文生说句话。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-01-text-08", "content": "我也在备考县试，书帖都买齐了；这几天又跟货郎约好学算账，还想找文生讨教衙门的门路。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-01-text-09", "content": "（回头望了一眼头坛的香炉）爹，等我考上了，也给你买个铜香炉。", "speakerId": "shisheng", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-01-text-10", "content": "（闷了半天）书要念，坡上的泉眼也半年没淘了，渠口等着水呢。", "speakerId": "fuqin", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "爹"}},
          {"id": "act-01-text-11", "content": "等我考完再说。守坛那点活儿，还能误了？", "speakerId": "shisheng", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-01-text-12", "content": "话是这么说，可书帖压在箱底，算盘挂在货郎担上，坛上的活儿，全推给了爹一个人。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-01-text-13", "content": "我样样都想要，样样都舍不得放。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}}
        ],
        "choices": [],
        "notes": "场景：九坛｜日｜晴。香炉、社旗、祭肉，头坛香火旺、九坛渐冷清。\n原始在场：我（石生，二十出头，第九坛坛户之子） · 爹（老坛户） · 文生（堂哥，中了秀才、在县衙当书办） · 三叔公（管族里坛务的） · 九村乡民（环境人物）\n迁移备注：受 characters maxItems=3 限制，三叔公的台词保留为文本说话人，不作摆位；乡民作背景远景。"
      },
      {
        "id": "act-02",
        "title": "县城·碰壁",
        "backgroundAssetId": "background.market-town-entrance-noon",
        "characters": [
          {"instanceId": "shisheng", "assetId": "character.shi-sheng", "position": "left"},
          {"instanceId": "wensheng", "assetId": "character.wen-sheng", "position": "right"}
        ],
        "texts": [
          {"id": "act-02-text-01", "content": "县试场里，我把文章一气写完，自我感觉比哪回都顺。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-02-text-02", "content": "先生批卷，就一句批语：字是好字，心是散的。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-02-text-03", "content": "散在哪儿？考学的心、当差的心、学算账的心——一根线，三处牵着。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-02-text-04", "content": "（找文生）哥，衙门还缺抄写不？我字好，我跟你学。", "speakerId": "shisheng", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-02-text-05", "content": "（压低声）缺额早叫人占喽。回吧——你那点心思，先归拢归拢再说。", "speakerId": "wensheng", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "文生"}},
          {"id": "act-02-text-06", "content": "出了衙门我又去货栈，一车山货的数，扒拉了半晌，账对不上，掌柜把算盘收了。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-02-text-07", "content": "（站在街口）我脑子又不笨……怎么就样样都来不及？", "speakerId": "shisheng", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-02-text-08", "content": "晌午的日头白花花的。出城的路口，不知什么时候站着个灰袍人，半张旧木面。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-02-text-09", "content": "两只手都攥着，你到底想拿哪一样？", "speakerId": "mystic", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "神秘人", "mystic": true}},
          {"id": "act-02-text-10", "content": "我想分辩——考学是正事，当差是正事，算账也是正事……可话到嘴边，一样都说不利索。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-02-text-11", "content": "一转眼，路口只剩日头。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-02-text-12", "content": "回村路过乱石坡。坡里的酸枣红了，我头一回没心思看。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}}
        ],
        "choices": [],
        "notes": "场景：县城｜晌午｜晴。考棚、衙门门房、货栈算盘。\n原始在场：我 · 文生 · 神秘人（第一次现身，城外路口） · 街市人群、货栈伙计（环境人物）\n迁移备注：考棚—衙门—货栈—城外路口—乱石坡多段小景按原文并入一幕；神秘人末段现身保留为画外文本，不作摆位。"
      },
      {
        "id": "act-03",
        "title": "社庙·夜谈",
        "backgroundAssetId": "background.shrine-temple-night",
        "characters": [
          {"instanceId": "miaozhu", "assetId": "character.old-temple-keeper", "position": "left"},
          {"instanceId": "shisheng", "assetId": "character.shi-sheng", "position": "right"}
        ],
        "texts": [
          {"id": "act-03-text-01", "content": "（灯下擦着九块小牌位）又来了？这回脸拉这么长。", "speakerId": "miaozhu", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "老庙祝"}},
          {"id": "act-03-text-02", "content": "庙祝爷爷，我问你句实话。人人都在往上奔，赶考的、当差的……守坛这种差事，是不是最没出息的那种？", "speakerId": "shisheng", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-03-text-03", "content": "（乐了）坛是人分的大小，神自己没分过。九位爷守了一千年，没一位挪过窝，也没一位跑去别人的坛上凑热闹。", "speakerId": "miaozhu", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "老庙祝"}},
          {"id": "act-03-text-04", "content": "可头坛管百亩好田，烧的是官家的高香。第九坛管啥？管一片荒坡？", "speakerId": "shisheng", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-03-text-05", "content": "谁跟你说那是荒坡？头坛的高香是人烧的，你坡上出的可是救命的泉水——天再旱，村西的秧水是它补的；前年发大水，修渠的石头是一块块从那儿背的。", "speakerId": "miaozhu", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "老庙祝"}},
          {"id": "act-03-text-06", "content": "那为啥没人给它上香？", "speakerId": "shisheng", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-03-text-07", "content": "香是人乐意烧的，水是地一直给的。（把牌位摆正）孩子，守坛不丢人，丢人的是守着坛，心里没坛。", "speakerId": "miaozhu", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "老庙祝"}},
          {"id": "act-03-text-08", "content": "我心里咯噔一下。这半年，我心里哪有坛——只有县试、衙门的门路、算盘。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-03-text-09", "content": "（低声）……那我该咋办？", "speakerId": "shisheng", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-03-text-10", "content": "（不接话，只把油灯挑亮了些）回去吧。你的心搁在哪儿，你自己摸摸看。", "speakerId": "miaozhu", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "老庙祝"}},
          {"id": "act-03-text-11", "content": "出庙门，天干得厉害。坡下渠口有人喊：泉眼眼瞅着要淤死了！", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}}
        ],
        "choices": [],
        "notes": "场景：社庙｜夜｜月。油灯、九块牌位、坛幡。\n原始在场：我 · 老庙祝（守庙五十年的社庙看守）\n迁移备注：无。"
      },
      {
        "id": "act-04",
        "title": "乱石坡·点拨与淘泉",
        "backgroundAssetId": "background.rocky-slope-dry-night",
        "characters": [
          {"instanceId": "shisheng", "assetId": "character.shi-sheng", "position": "left"},
          {"instanceId": "fuqin", "assetId": "character.fuqin", "position": "center"},
          {"instanceId": "mystic", "assetId": "character.mystic-gray", "position": "right"}
        ],
        "texts": [
          {"id": "act-04-text-01", "content": "当夜，我扛着锄头上坡——泉眼再不淘，明早分水就得出岔子。可县试二场就在三日后，书还没背全，心里乱得像坡上的石头。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-04-text-02", "content": "泉眼让塌石和淤泥堵了个严实，半点水星都不冒。褡裢里的书帖，硌着我的背。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-04-text-03", "content": "（坡上不知何时立着）书读不进的时候，你在想啥？", "speakerId": "mystic", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "神秘人", "mystic": true}},
          {"id": "act-04-text-04", "content": "（一愣）……在想坡上的泉，还有没修完的渠。", "speakerId": "shisheng", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-04-text-05", "content": "账算错的时候呢？", "speakerId": "mystic", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "神秘人", "mystic": true}},
          {"id": "act-04-text-06", "content": "在想哪段渠该先淘。", "speakerId": "shisheng", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-04-text-07", "content": "那不就是了。你的心，一直搁在这坡上。想清楚喽——你最想办的，是哪件事？", "speakerId": "mystic", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "神秘人", "mystic": true}},
          {"id": "act-04-text-08", "content": "（蹲在泉眼边，半晌）……把坡上的水，治明白。", "speakerId": "shisheng", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-04-text-09", "content": "话一出口，我自己都愣了——这些年东抓西抓，心里搁着的，原来是这一件。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-04-text-10", "content": "我把书帖从褡裢里抽出来，压在第九坛的界石底下，抄起锄头，一锄一锄掏起淤来。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-04-text-11", "content": "这一淘就是五天。白天下渠，夜里守泉，手上的泡破了又结；县试二场过没过，我没去打听。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-04-text-12", "content": "第五天头上，泉眼彻底掏通了，底下的水咕地冒上来。我顺着旧渠一段一段垒引，傍晚时分，水头爬进了村西的秧田。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-04-text-13", "content": "（蹲在渠口看了半天）你这手上的活儿，比你太爷爷那会儿的，还利索。", "speakerId": "fuqin", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "爹"}},
          {"id": "act-04-text-14", "content": "（抹了把脸）差事小，得有人当真办。", "speakerId": "shisheng", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-04-text-15", "content": "坡上陆陆续续来了人，都望着那道水。人群外头，灰袍人朝我点了点头，转身走了。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}}
        ],
        "choices": [],
        "notes": "场景：乱石坡｜夜起连日｜晴旱。淤死的泉眼、界石与书帖、旧渠锄头。\n原始在场：我 · 爹 · 神秘人（第二次现身，点拨） · 闻讯上坡的乡民（环境人物）\n迁移备注：五日淘泉按原文并入一幕；乡民作背景远景。"
      },
      {
        "id": "act-05",
        "title": "第九坛·次年春社",
        "backgroundAssetId": "background.ninth-altar-morning-fog",
        "characters": [
          {"instanceId": "shisheng", "assetId": "character.shi-sheng", "position": "left"},
          {"instanceId": "fuqin", "assetId": "character.fuqin", "position": "center"},
          {"instanceId": "mystic", "assetId": "character.mystic-gray", "position": "right"}
        ],
        "texts": [
          {"id": "act-05-text-01", "content": "第二年春社，头坛前照旧挤满了人，锣鼓敲得震天。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-02", "content": "第九坛前清静，可不再空着。放羊的老倌路过，点了三炷香；村西的田户挑水路过，也点了三炷。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-03", "content": "这一年，我又给渠加了道堰，淘泉挖出的淤土，垫了半坡的薄地。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-04", "content": "（路过，替我扶了扶香炉）二场没见你的人，娘还念叨呢。县试明年还有——不考啦？", "speakerId": "wensheng", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "文生"}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-05", "content": "（笑了笑）考不考，往后再说。眼下我最想办的，是这坡上的事。", "speakerId": "shisheng", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "我", "self": true}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-06", "content": "（把新坛幡挂上去，退后看了看）比你太爷爷那会儿的，还周正。", "speakerId": "fuqin", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "爹"}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-07", "content": "这话头一回，我听着像夸我。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-08", "content": "雾从坡下漫上来。灰袍人立在坛前，半张木面朝着晨光，像等了有些时候了。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-09", "content": "石生——不，该改口了。求愿的人，梦到这儿，该醒了。", "speakerId": "mystic", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "神秘人", "mystic": true}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-10", "content": "你进来的时候，求的是什么，我都听见了。那时候你手里攥着四样东西，样样都想要，样样都没攥牢。", "speakerId": "mystic", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "神秘人", "mystic": true}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-11", "content": "后来你想清楚了，认下最想办的那一件，一天一天往里使劲——这坛上的活水，就是你使出来的劲。", "speakerId": "mystic", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "神秘人", "mystic": true}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-12", "content": "官帽是旁人的坛，你的泉，浇的是你的田。坛有大小，可没有哪座坛，生来就该荒着。", "speakerId": "mystic", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "神秘人", "mystic": true}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-13", "content": "不是所有事都该攥在同一只手里。能分清轻重，把散乱的心力安回各自位置，让手头这一处重新运转的人，就是持衡者。", "speakerId": "mystic", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "dialogue", "speakerName": "神秘人", "mystic": true}},
          {"id": "act-05-text-14", "content": "他转身走进雾里。坡下的社鼓声退去。我摊开手心，掌纹里全是新渠的泥，沉甸甸的。", "speakerId": "narrator", "display": {"mode": "typewriter", "advance": "manual"}, "extensions": {"sourceType": "narration"}}
        ],
        "choices": [],
        "notes": "场景：第九坛｜晨｜雾。修齐的渠口、新坛幡、几炷香。\n原始在场：我 · 文生（一句） · 爹（一句） · 神秘人（第三次现身，坛前，向求愿者直接开口） · 上香的村人（环境人物）\n迁移备注：受 characters maxItems=3 限制，文生的台词保留为文本说话人，不作摆位；上香村人作背景远景。原剧本幕五神秘人第二句中的动态占位符（所求何事）已按交付决定改写为固定句。"
      }
    ]
  }
}
